    <sh:property>
      <sh:PropertyShape rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/snb/model/application-profile/edc-generic-no-cv/Amount-elm_unit">
        <sh:description xml:lang="da">En kode, der angiver den valuta, som en pengeværdi angives/udtrykkes i. Den angivne værdi skal tages fra listen Currency Named Authority (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/currency).</sh:description>
        <sh:name xml:lang="fi">Yksikkö</sh:name>
        <sh:name xml:lang="pt">Unidade</sh:name>
        <sh:description xml:lang="cs">Kód označující měnu, ve které je uvedena/vyjádřena peněžní hodnota. Poskytnutá hodnota musí být převzata ze Seznamu Určených orgánů pro měnu (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/currency).</sh:description>
        <sh:name xml:lang="sl">Enota</sh:name>
        <sh:name xml:lang="it">Unità</sh:name>
        <sh:name xml:lang="mt">Unità</sh:name>
        <sh:name xml:lang="lv">Mērvienība</sh:name>
        <sh:description xml:lang="fr">Un code indiquant la devise dans laquelle la valeur monétaire est exprimée. La valeur fournie doit provenir de la liste d’autorités de la Devise (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/currency).</sh:description>
        <sh:description xml:lang="no">En kode som indikerer valutaen som en pengeverdi er angitt/uttrykt i. Den oppgitte verdien må komme fra Currency Named Authority-listen (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/currency).</sh:description>
        <sh:description xml:lang="mk">Код кој укажува на валутата во која е означена/изразена монетарната вредност. Наведената вредност мора да доаѓа од листата на надлежните органи на именуваната валута (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/currency).</sh:description>
        <sh:name xml:lang="nl">Eenheid</sh:name>
        <sh:name xml:lang="sk">Jednotka</sh:name>
        <sh:name xml:lang="de">Einheit</sh:name>
        <sh:name xml:lang="cs">Jednotka</sh:name>
        <sh:description xml:lang="me">Šifra koja označava valutu u kojoj je prikazana/izražena novčana vrijednost. Navedena vrijednost mora da potiče sa liste ovlašćenja sa nazivima valuta (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authoriti/currenci).</sh:description>
        <sh:severity rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation"/>
        <sh:description xml:lang="lv">Kods, kas norāda valūtu, kurā ir norādīta/izteikta monetārā vērtība. Var norādīt tikai vērtības, kas ņemtas no valūtu nosaukumu autoritatīvā saraksta (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/currency).</sh:description>
        <sh:description xml:lang="bg">Код за обозначаване на валутата, в която е посочена/изразена парична стойност. Посочената стойност трябва да е от номенклатурния списък на валутите (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/currency).</sh:description>
        <sh:name xml:lang="mk">Единица</sh:name>
        <sh:name xml:lang="bg">Единица</sh:name>
        <sh:description xml:lang="en">The unit of the amount. A controlled vocabulary should be used (code) to indicate the currency in which the amount is indicated/expressed.</sh:description>
        <sh:description xml:lang="es">Un código que indique la moneda en la que se indica o expresa un valor monetario. El valor facilitado debe proceder de la Lista autorizada de nombres Moneda (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/currency).</sh:description>
        <sh:name xml:lang="pl">Jednostka</sh:name>
        <sh:description xml:lang="sl">Oznaka, ki označuje valuto, v kateri je navedena/izražena denarna vrednost. Navedena vrednost mora izhajati z referenčnega seznama valut (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/currency).</sh:description>
        <sh:minCount rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"
        >1</sh:minCount>
        <sh:name xml:lang="ga">Aonad</sh:name>
        <sh:name xml:lang="da">Enhed</sh:name>
        <sh:description xml:lang="fi">Koodi, joka ilmaisee valuutan, jossa rahallinen arvo ilmoitetaan. Arvon on oltava Currency (valuutta) -NAL-luettelon mukainen(http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/currency).</sh:description>
        <sh:description xml:lang="el">Κωδικός που δηλώνει το νόμισμα στο οποίο αναφέρεται/εκφράζεται μια χρηματική αξία. Η παρεχόμενη τιμή πρέπει να προέρχεται από τον κατάλογο εγκεκριμένων ονομάτων «Currency» (Νόμισμα) (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/currency).</sh:description>
        <sh:path rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/snb/model/ontology/unit"/>
        <sh:description xml:lang="pl">Kod wskazujący walutę, w której podana/wyrażona jest wartość pieniężna. Podana wartość musi pochodzić z autorytatywnego wykazu walut (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/currency).</sh:description>
        <sh:description xml:lang="is">Kóði sem gefur til kynna þann gjaldmiðil sem peningalegt gildi tekur mið af. Ef til staðar, þarf gildið að koma af lista yfir Gjaldmiðlaheiti yfirvalda (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/currency).</sh:description>
        <sh:description xml:lang="hu">Annak a pénznemnek a kódja, amelyben a monetáris érték fel van tüntetve/ki van fejezve. A megadott értéknek a pénznemek szójegyzékéből kell származnia (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/currency).</sh:description>
        <sh:description xml:lang="mt">Kodiċi li jindika l-munita li fiha jiġi indikat/espress valur fi flus. Il-valur ipprovdut irid jiġi mil-Lista tal-Awtorità Imsemmija tal-Muniti (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/currency).</sh:description>
        <sh:name xml:lang="ro">Unitatea</sh:name>
        <sh:name xml:lang="sr">0.0</sh:name>
        <sh:description xml:lang="hr">Oznaka valute u kojoj je novčana vrijednost navedena/izražena. Navedena vrijednost mora biti s popisa valuta imenovanog tijela (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country).</sh:description>
        <sh:order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"
        >3</sh:order>
        <sh:name xml:lang="el">Μονάδα</sh:name>
        <sh:description xml:lang="ro">Un cod care indică moneda în care este indicată/exprimată o valoare monetară. Valoarea furnizată trebuie să provină din lista de monede desemnate ale autorității (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/currency).</sh:description>
        <sh:description xml:lang="tr">Parasal değerin belirtildiği/ifade edildiği para birimini gösteren bir kod. Verilen değer Para Birimi Adı Verilmiş Yetkili Listesinden gelmelidir (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/currency).</sh:description>
        <sh:description xml:lang="en">A code indicating the currency in which a monetary value is indicated/expressed. The provided value must come from the Currency Named Authority List (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/currency).</sh:description>
        <sh:description xml:lang="pt">Um código que indica a moeda em que é indicado/expresso um valor monetário. O valor indicado deve provir da lista de autoridade relativa às moedas (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/currency).</sh:description>
        <sh:name xml:lang="en">unit</sh:name>
        <sh:name xml:lang="et">Ühik</sh:name>
        <sh:name xml:lang="is">Eining</sh:name>
        <sh:name xml:lang="es">Unidad</sh:name>
        <sh:description xml:lang="de">Ein Code, der die Währung angibt, in der ein Geldwert angegeben/ausgedrückt wird. Der angegebene Wert muss aus der Währungsautoritätsliste stammen (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/currency).</sh:description>
        <sh:description xml:lang="ga">Cód lena léirítear an t-airgeadra ina léirítear/ina sloinntear luach airgeadaíochta. Ní mór an luach a chuirfear ar fáil teacht ó Liosta na nÚdarás Ainmnithe de réir Airgeadra (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/currency).</sh:description>
        <sh:name xml:lang="me">Jedinica</sh:name>
        <sh:name xml:lang="hr">Jedinica</sh:name>
        <sh:name xml:lang="tr">Birim</sh:name>
        <sh:maxCount rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"
        >1</sh:maxCount>
        <sh:description xml:lang="lt">Kodas, nurodantis valiutą, kuria nurodoma/išreiškiama piniginė vertė. Pateikta vertė turi būti iš valiutų vardinių autoritetinių duomenų sąrašo (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/currency).</sh:description>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/snb/model/application-profile/edc-generic-no-cv"/>
        <sh:name xml:lang="no">Enhet</sh:name>
        <sh:name xml:lang="sv">Enhet</sh:name>
        <sh:name xml:lang="fr">Unité</sh:name>
        <sh:description xml:lang="it">Codice che indica la valuta in cui è indicato/espresso un valore monetario. Il valore fornito deve essere tratto dalle valute indicate nell'elenco delle autorità designate (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/currency).</sh:description>
        <sh:description xml:lang="sv">En kod som anger i vilken valuta det monetära värdet anges/uttrycks. Det tillhandahållna värdet måste komma från auktoritetsregistret för namn på valutor (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/currency).</sh:description>
        <sh:description xml:lang="sk">Kód uvádzajúci menu, v ktorej sa uvádza/vyjadruje peňažná hodnota. Poskytnutá hodnota musí byť zo zoznamu určených orgánov pre menu (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/currency).</sh:description>
        <sh:description xml:lang="nl">Een code die aangeeft in welke valuta een monetaire waarde wordt aangegeven/uitgedrukt. De verstrekte waarde moet afkomstig zijn uit de standaardnamenlijst van valuta’s (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/currency).</sh:description>
        <sh:description xml:lang="et">Kood, mis näitab valuutat, milles rahaline väärtus on näidatud/väljendatud. Märgitud väärtus peab pärinema valuuta normandmeloendist.(http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/currency).</sh:description>
        <sh:name xml:lang="lt">Vienetas</sh:name>
        <sh:name xml:lang="hu">Egység</sh:name>
        <sh:description xml:lang="sr">Шифра валуте у којој је новчана вредност назначена/изражена. Наведена вредност мора да потиче са именованог одобреног списка Валута (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/currency).</sh:description>
        <sh:class rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
      </sh:PropertyShape>
    </sh:property>
